{"author_association": "NONE", "body": "Acknowledged. We took community analysis at face value, including outputs from prior LLM-assisted solvers, without sufficiently questioning whether the data was independently verifiable. That's a fair criticism.\n\nWhat we can verify ourselves, without relying on anything posted here: the Phase 2 and 3 decryptions, the 7 SalPhaseIon tokens, K_C1, K_I1, the full L4 decoding derived independently via crib-drag, including the part that ends with \"CIAO BELLA O.\" None of that came from this repo.\n\nThe warning is noted. We know what we own.", "created_at": "2026-03-13T17:18:23Z", "html_url": "https://github.com/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/87#issuecomment-4056698394", "id": 4056698394, "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/87", "minimized": null, "node_id": "IC_kwDOD23F087xzE4a", "performed_via_github_app": null, "pin": null, "reactions": {"+1": 0, "-1": 0, "confused": 0, "eyes": 0, "heart": 0, "hooray": 0, "laugh": 0, "rocket": 0, "total_count": 0, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/4056698394/reactions"}, "updated_at": "2026-03-13T17:18:23Z", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/puzzlehunt/gsmgio-5btc-puzzle/issues/comments/4056698394", "user": {"avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267985838?v=4", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EnigmAnderson/events{/privacy}", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EnigmAnderson/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EnigmAnderson/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EnigmAnderson/gists{/gist_id}", "gravatar_id": "", "html_url": "https://github.com/EnigmAnderson", "id": 267985838, "login": "EnigmAnderson", "node_id": "U_kgDOD_kjrg", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EnigmAnderson/orgs", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/EnigmAnderson/received_events", "repos_url": "https://